(Bug #71: `{label:.2}` printed `0.00` - the rodata pointer read as a
 double. The precision path ran before any type check at all, which is why
 it leaked a value the width path had already been taught to refuse
 (v0.4.7, #36).

 A decimal place is a place in a NUMBER's expansion; a text has none.)

a text called label is "hi".
Print "{label:.2}".
